<title>USA: A.M. Best downgrades Golden Eagle rating.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best downgrades Golden Eagle rating.</headline>
<dateline>OLDWICK, N.J. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Best Co said Friday it had lowered its rating on Golden Eagle Insurance Co to &quot;E&quot; (Under State Supervision) from &quot;B-&quot; (Adequate) and removed it from under review.</p>
<p>The company said it downgraded the rating following the California Department of Insurance's seizure of Golden's assets, books and records.</p>
